{"server":"cn","storyId":"act49side_level_act49side_01_beg","groupId":"act49side","stageId":"act49side_01","title":"激石波","storyCode":"TA-1","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act49side/level_act49side_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"587ffc557129ca9f67132e280372c88021b0d8b91d861fd88affe8a98b3ec125","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=2>望日前三日</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是雷声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"只是雷声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"已经是深秋了，要是拖到入冬，下了雪，路会很难走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"晖洁......你应当回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“回”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回哪里去？龙门？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你想知道的事，我都已经告诉你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你应该明白，眼下的这些事，都与你无关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真想感叹......你大概也是真的老了，舅舅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换作五年前的你，这会儿应该早已经和我动过手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你的性子到底也是变了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"留在这驿馆的几天，你的问题也并不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我还是信不过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你讲的那些事......关于那位太师，关于你的弟弟——我素未谋面的“另一位舅舅”，还有那位老真龙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有权力对这些事评论什么。非要说的话，我倒是庆幸，最终不是由你来为炎国的许多事做决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这一点我同样不否认......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的确还是想知道你离开百灶时到底在想什么，母亲为什么也跟着你来到龙门，又为何留了下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不指望在这个时候能从你口中听到一个公正的答案，听到你对那些往事最客观的陈述。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我会自己搞清楚——我是不会走的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你总有在关键的时候把事情搞砸的本事，尤其是在这种和你自己有关的事上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就当是防止你再做蠢事也好，甚至是保护你也好——我都不会走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们都省省吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"晖洁......你这些年——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一样，也没什么好说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"或许等到你愿意说的时候......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈晖洁向窗外看去。\n远处移动城市的灯火已经暗淡了数天，百灶城的轮廓在夜幕中模糊着，像是蛰伏巨兽的脊背。\n她试图去想象，那些对自己而言不久前才被证实的古老传说中的庞然巨物。\n细碎的秋雨不断敲打着窗户，声乱如麻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还是没有消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那就已经是最好的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此，我们没办法期待任何好的转机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说，如果百灶城那边有任何异动......玉门就会立刻开战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所说的“岁兽”能造成的动乱，还有这一战的结果......无人可以确定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是大炎隐藏了上千年的秘密......你们还真是一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是事有蹊跷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"当下情势已经万分紧急，可过去十日，玉门和百灶之间来往的信使不超过三班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是玉门战时应该有的状态。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公，有客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这个时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"请进来就是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"魏公别来无恙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅也安好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您就是......炎国太傅？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我之前的确不知道，陈家小姐也在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您为何......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈很确信自己从来没有见过这位老人。\n他那分不清是威严还是慈爱的目光从自己身上划过，只一眼，他就准确地认出了自己。\n紧接着，他又将那道令人捉摸不透的目光投向魏彦吾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这是另一回事，说来话长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的确听了我的意见，留在了这座驿馆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有不信任太傅的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"之前是信使，今天是太傅亲自到这来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是有必须要和魏公说清的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"晖洁，回避。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一会要说的事，她最好也留下来听听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"如今百灶城中境况......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中秋后，陛下特准他进入岁陵，尝试平息岁兽之患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可望日临近，岁陵中依然没有动静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而此时此刻，大炎周遭还有五只巨兽盘踞，不知祂们意欲何为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天机阁的天师，还有大炎最精锐的战士已经前往巨兽所在的各地，大炎并不惮于这一战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但最坏的结果，不只是与五只巨兽同时开战。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“不知意欲何为”——这白胡子老头倒是会说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上千年的血仇，这时候找上门，还能是来串门送礼的不成？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......说什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这时候，应当已经有不少人力主开战了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此刻重要的不再是某一派的意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只怕大炎已经没有选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"朝廷应当对此有过无数种预案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在无数种预案中，也不存在一种惨胜之外的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但依然还有我们不曾考虑过的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅，告诉我，胞弟不曾想过要自己去开启“不反”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是真龙，大炎的真龙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如若大炎真到了不得已的时候，也只有他能行此事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......简直荒唐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此，我们不必再顾左右而言他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那封送到龙门的密信，在禁军动身前还无人知晓。而我今天来见魏公，却不曾掩人耳目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公应当明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这些旧事......四十年的旧事，上千年的旧事......绝对不该以这种方式收场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......绝对不该，是由他去付出这个代价。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无人愿意见到那个最坏的局面，但绝不可自欺欺人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有必要提醒魏公——哪怕只是为大炎计，为天下计。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当留后手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，太傅说的“后手”是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您刚刚说的这些事，和魏彦吾......有什么关系？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这还听不明白？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"后手就是后手，事情办砸的时候该做的事就叫后手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......这是在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"国不可一日无君，少了一位真龙，那自然得再补上一位真龙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"父死子替，兄退弟进，几千年来都是这么传过来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是别人都不在了，这女娃自然也是要去当真龙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们在胡说八道什么？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......晖洁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才的声音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......都没听到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不苛求魏公在此刻想清万般利害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行事当三思，但时间毕竟紧迫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公，珍重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......我送太傅一程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，那位太傅的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他特意让我留在这里，但我一点也听不明白你们所说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"晖洁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么叫炎国很有可能马上要大动干戈，却让你做好准备？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“不反”“巨兽”......你和这些事到底有什么联系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"晖洁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"过去曾有许多错......有的是我亲自铸就，有的则是我无力阻止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我唯一在坚持的，是不让那些已经无力改变的错，祸及你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"只因我从不曾怀疑，你能做到的比我们更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别在这时候说这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，你上一次见到塔露拉，她还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我才不会在这个时候告诉你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的还在乎她，就不要在这种时候问她的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文月姨不愿意见你永远当那个老顽固，她在意你的安危，我也不想——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果你真的还在乎除了你自己之外的谁，就不要把他们全都抛在身后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，舅舅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底准备做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"听上去，她活得应当还好，至少不坏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要那样轻飘飘地下评判！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还不知道她到底经历了什么牺牲，更不知道她最后——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是乐意这样，一个劲自顾自地对过去的事伤感个没完，那也随你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要出去透透气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"细密的秋雨兀自缠绵，如同断续的思绪纠缠不休。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彦吾，我对你和你的城市，你这座金玉其外败絮其中的城市......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"已经厌倦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g13_reunionfarm"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1968_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到北方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1968_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北边的矿场，那里有人需要我们的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1968_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经等不起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在现在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片农场呢，留在这里的人怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1968_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有的同胞会留下来，他们会彼此照顾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1968_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你还愿意的话，也可以加入他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不放心你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1968_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你同样可以跟着我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1968_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的话，我希望能获得你的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_npc_662_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1968_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晖洁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1968_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你说的，也许存在一个可以审判感染者......也可以收容所有感染者的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1968_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但它不在这里，不在过去，不在现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1968_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它只会在将来，在我们要去的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1968_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要向前去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是向前走了......然后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去的事到底是追了上来......还是我自己找了回去？呵，过去的事从来没有真的过去过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，如果是你......如果是你看到这些事，又会怎么想？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，瞻前顾后，优柔寡断，有勇无决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个娃娃，到底不像她的先祖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"千年来，那位祖龙的后裔少说也有几万号人，其中英雄几何，庸才几何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这一点血脉又能决定多少事呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是眼前这位至今依然浑浑噩噩，如在梦里，如何能以重任相委？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还是因为那几个老头子各个倔得像老木头，又硬又倔，嘴巴里三棍子打不出一句话，也不能怪这些晚辈担不起事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看她这一路来造化也算不寻常，除了剑上的蛮功夫，应该多少有点过人之处才对。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是谁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别再装神弄鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......现身说话！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知何处传来的飘渺声音再度响起，这一次才听得真切。\n陈晖洁这才确认今晚纠缠自己已久的絮语并非幻觉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g07_fairyland_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，瞧这丫头，见识不大脾气不小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"衣着朴素的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_2131_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有这份心倒是好事，你要是真想知道，你自己去看就是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"70_g1_tjoutside"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是见鬼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是驿馆那边？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g13_yanlivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"陈家小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们都站在这里做什么......出什么事了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐最后一次见到魏公是什么时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不到半个时辰以前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"看来您也不知魏公下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你们是说——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"两刻前，魏公屏退我等，自己一人在房中休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"直到方才，店主送餐却发现房中无人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"我们搜遍了整个驿馆，也不见魏公的踪影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公现在......下落不明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有留言。\n空着的旅舍如同不曾有客来过一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人，竟然还能在你们眼皮底下溜走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又一次......魏彦吾，又一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，之前魏公收到当今真龙亲笔，邀他赴京。我等劝阻无果，只得相随前来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"姑且揣测，魏公现在已经前往京城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"我等未能护好魏公周全，罪无可赦。可若此刻擅闯京城，只怕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"陈打断了影卫的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，他不辞而别总是事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"avg_1050_chen3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次......我绝对会找到他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彦吾"]}]}
